    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0222","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Greta Søndergaard talks about a dot, considered at length. The artist insists the recording itself is the artwork and that we are now co-authors.</Description>
